# Outputs: numeric parquets are committable (annotation- and detection-derived
# coordinates). Per SoccerNet (2026-06-01), annotation-derived data is open source;
# video-derived numeric outputs are permitted, but raw/rendered video must not be
# redistributed. So the parquets below are tracked; only actual video media stays out.
#
# Exploratory diagnostic scatters (regenerated on demand; not thesis artifacts).
outputs/figures/diagnostics/
# SoccerNet video media: rendered from league-copyrighted frames — not redistributable.
outputs/figures/annotated/
outputs/figures/overlay/
outputs/figures/*.mp4
outputs/figures/*.gif
outputs/figures/still_*.png